@startuml
title UC-OL-001 发布公众号排版需求 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "兄弟部门成员或运营部部长" as A
boundary "接口:普通成员接口" as B
control "控制:发布公众号排版需求控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "L:公众号排版任务" as L
participant "RA:审核岗位安排" as RA
A -> B: 发布公众号排版需求(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 发布公众号排版需求(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> L: 发布排版需求(标题、类型、截止日期、说明、附件)
activate L
L -> RA: 核验审核资格(待派发排版任务)
RA --> L: 岗位安排可在派发时指定
L --> C: 待接单或待派发排版任务
deactivate L

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
